  "description": "The fictional demo personas of a demo install (D-39): one for each of the fifteen human product roles, a second configuration admin so that a configuration change one admin proposes is answered by another person, and Marcus Oyelaran, a second architect and change board member, so that a design or change board decision one of them proposes is answered by another person: seventeen in all, played by people of seed/demo-estate.json. In the Demo environment only, the person signed in to the web app may act as any of them by sending the X-Product-Demo-Persona header with the persona's name; every write is then stamped with the persona and the Client App label \"Web app, demo operator\". Each persona's groups are fictional role groups that seed/demo-binding.patch.json binds to the persona's role. Read through Product:WebApp:DemoPersonasFile. Every ID is a patterned placeholder and every name is fictional. A persona's teams are the fictional support teams of the demo estate it is in (Field Apps Support, Finance Apps Support, Service Desk, Platform Team), which bind no product role: the Teams page lists the persona among their members, and a request as the persona carries only its groups.",
